[Graphics:Activated Terminal]
A terminal's current type becomes #N$0E when a program packet arrives. These
four frames are entity types #N$70 to #N$73.
#UDGTABLE(default,centre,centre,centre,centre,centre,centre,centre,centre)
  { =h,c2 Frame 1 | =h,c2 Frame 2 | =h,c2 Frame 3 | =h,c2 Frame 4 }
  { #N$70 | #SPRITE$70(activated-terminal-01*) | #N$71 | #SPRITE$71(activated-terminal-02*) | #N$72 | #SPRITE$72(activated-terminal-03*) | #N$73 | #SPRITE$73(activated-terminal-04*) }
UDGTABLE#

[Graphics:Installed Program]
Map cells of type #N$02. The frames are entity types #N$74 to #N$77. Types
#N$04 and #N$05 show the first and third frames, and nothing selects them.
#UDGTABLE(default,centre,centre,centre,centre,centre,centre,centre,centre)
  { =h,c2 Frame 1 | =h,c2 Frame 2 | =h,c2 Frame 3 | =h,c2 Frame 4 }
  { #N$74 | #SPRITE$74(installed-program-01*) | #N$75 | #SPRITE$75(installed-program-02*) | #N$76 | #SPRITE$76(installed-program-03*) | #N$77 | #SPRITE$77(installed-program-04*) }
UDGTABLE#
